tertiary just means highly specialized advanced care, right?

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:34.820
Precisely.

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:37.180
We are talking about complex trauma care,

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.300
advanced oncology for those cancer concerns

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.860
we just discussed, major surgical interventions

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.820
or advanced obstetrics.

